# Build output
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Local secrets and per-environment overrides — never bake these into an image.
# (.env holds OPENROUTER_API_KEY and the Postgres connection string.)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Operator's MCP config (bind-mounted at run time, never baked in).
**/config.jsonc
!**/config.jsonc.example

# Editor / VCS noise
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/

# Not needed inside the image
**/Dockerfile
**/*.http
**/docker/
**/justfile
**/AGENTS.md
**/skills-lock.json
